DESCRIPTION > Simulated Riff campaign traffic and conversion events.

SCHEMA >
    `campaign_id` UUID,
    `experiment_id` UUID,
    `variant_id` UUID,
    `event_id` UUID,
    `visitor_id` UUID,
    `timestamp` DateTime64(3, 'UTC'),
    `event_type` LowCardinality(String),
    `cost_cents` UInt32

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY "toYYYYMM(timestamp)"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "campaign_id, experiment_id, timestamp, event_id"
